<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scor started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said on Friday it started coverage of French reinsurer Scor SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Scor differentiates itself through a clean balance sheet, technical expertise in selected lines of business, its international portfolio diversification and strong service orientation which adds to the stability of the client base,&quot; analyst Nikola Wendelstadt wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Wendelstadt added, &quot;We rate the stock a buy, with a 12- to 18-month target price of FF255, representing a 37 percent gain over the current share price.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
